                            "settings": {
                                "html": "<div class='approach-wrap'>\n  <div class='approach-head'>\n    <div class='approach-head-text'>\n      <span class='approach-label'>Our Approach</span>\n      <h2>What makes<br /><i>Stillness different</i></h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class='approach-head-desc'>\n      <p>We don't offer classes. We offer experiences. There's a difference &mdash; and you'll feel it the moment you walk in.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  \n  <div class='approach-grid-wrap'>\n    <div class='approach-grid'>\n      <div class='approach-card'>\n        <div class='ap-num'>01</div>\n        <h3>Experiential, not educational</h3>\n        <p>You don't leave knowing more. You leave feeling different. Every session is designed to create a real, physical shift &mdash; not just a mental one.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class='approach-card'>\n        <div class='ap-num'>02</div>\n        <h3>Led by someone in it</h3>\n        <p>Our founder isn't teaching from a textbook. She's facilitating from lived experience. That's not a marketing line. You'll feel it in the room.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class='approach-card'>\n        <div class='ap-num'>03</div>\n        <h3>Honest, not mystical</h3>\n        <p>We skip the jargon. No toxic positivity. No pressure to \"transform.\" Just a real space where you can slow down and feel what's actually there.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class='approach-card'>\n        <div class='ap-num'>04</div>\n        <h3>Rooted in community</h3>\n        <p>We're a Vancouver company. Our sessions are intimate. Our community is real. We're not a platform &mdash; we're a place.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class='approach-card'>\n        <div class='ap-num'>05</div>\n        <h3>A safe container</h3>\n        <p>Everything we create is designed to help you feel held. You don't need to be ready. You just need to show up.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class='approach-card'>\n        <div class='ap-num'>06</div>\n        <h3>Generational thinking</h3>\n        <p>We work with adults. And we build tools for children. Because healing is more powerful when it starts early.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<style>\n.approach-wrap { width: 100%; }\n.approach-head { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 64px; align-items: flex-end; margin-bottom: 80px; }\n@media (max-width: 768px) { .approach-head { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; margin-bottom: 48px; } }\n.approach-label { display: block; font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 3px; font-weight: 700; color: #688F9D; margin-bottom: 24px; }\n.approach-head-text h2 { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 48px; color: #1D3152; line-height: 1.1; margin: 0; }\n.approach-head-text i { font-style: italic; }\n@media (max-width: 768px) { .approach-head-text h2 { font-size: 40px; } }\n.approach-head-desc p { font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(14, 27, 48, 0.7); margin: 0; }\n\n.approach-grid-wrap { background: rgba(104, 143, 157, 0.2); border: 1.5px solid rgba(104, 143, 157, 0.2); padding: 1.5px; }\n.approach-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.5px; background: rgba(104, 143, 157, 0.2); }\n@media (max-width: 1024px) { .approach-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }\n@media (max-width: 640px) { .approach-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }\n.approach-card { background: #FFFFFF; padding: 48px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; transition: background 0.5s ease; }\n.approach-card:hover { background: rgba(217, 232, 235, 0.3); }\n@media (max-width: 768px) { .approach-card { padding: 40px; } }\n.ap-num { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 300; color: rgba(104, 143, 157, 0.4); line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 24px; }\n.approach-card h3 { font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #0E1B30; margin: 0 0 16px; }\n.approach-card p { font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(14, 27, 48, 0.7); margin: 0; }\n</style>"
                            },
